# lltcgweb architecture

**Post-overhaul rules (do not regress):** [`.cursor/rules/lltcgweb-overhaul.mdc`](lltcgweb-overhaul.mdc)  
**Progress:** [`docs/OVERHAUL_PROGRESS.md`](../../docs/OVERHAUL_PROGRESS.md)

## Repository layout

| Area | Path | Notes |
|------|------|-------|
| PHP entry shims | Root `*.php` | Keep deploy paths stable (`tcg/api.php`, etc.) |
| PHP modules | `src/` | New logic goes here (PSR-4 `LLTCG\`) |
| Match persistence | `src/Game/Store/` | `GameStoreInterface` — file or Redis via env |
| Config | `config/` | `paths.php`, `cors.php`, `rate_limit.php` |
| Client JS | `client/js/` | Modules + `components/` — do not grow `index.html` |
| Client CSS | `client/css/` | `shell-all.css` (+ tokens/board/hub/prompts splits) |
| Overhaul docs | `docs/overhaul/` | Match store, components, ability IR, realtime |
| Tests | `tests/`, `scripts/` | Run before deploy |
| Migrations | `migrations/*.sql` | Versioned SQLite schema |
| Runtime (gitignored) | `data/`, `games/`, `experiment_decks/`, `cardimg/` | Use `tcgPath()` / env vars |

## Runtime vs source

See [docs/RUNTIME.md](docs/RUNTIME.md). Never commit `data/tcg.db`, `games/*.json`, secrets, or art.

## Deploy surfaces

| Surface | What lives there |
|---------|------------------|
| Hostinger `/tcg/` | Static UI, catalog, account/decks/login bonus, card images; match API only until cutover |
| VPS overflow / match-primary | Redis rooms + PHP `api.php` actions when `TCG_GAME_STORE=redis` + client `TCG_MATCH_API_PRIMARY` |
| VPS SSE | Seq notify (`tcg_sync`) — not full state |

Production Hostinger deploy: Chiichan `deploy-loveliveradio-ca.sh` with `LLR_TCG_ROOT` → this repo. **Do not** require a `public/` docroot change on Hostinger until production Docker ([docs/DEPLOY.md](docs/DEPLOY.md)).

## Path configuration

Use `config/paths.php` (`tcgPath()`, `tcgDefinePathConstants()`). Env overrides: `TCG_DATA_DIR`, `TCG_GAMES_DIR`, `TCG_GAME_STORE`, `TCG_REDIS_URL`, etc. ([.env.example](.env.example)).

## Verification

Before merging TCG changes:

```bash
composer test
php scripts/validate_json.php
php scripts/validate_cards.php
php scripts/validate_ability_ir.php
bash scripts/lint_php.sh
```
